Package: lingofuse
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for the LingoFuse Cross-Language RPC Framework
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("LingoFuse", "Team", email = "noreply@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R bindings for LingoFuse, a cross-language,
    cross-process, cross-machine RPC framework. Call any function
    written in another LingoFuse-aware language, or expose R functions
    to be called by them. Uses R's C interface for zero-copy data
    exchange. The wire format is byte-identical to the Pascal, Python,
    C++, C#, TypeScript, JavaScript, Rust, Go, Dart, Java, Swift, Zig,
    Erlang, Ruby, Fortran, and Julia bindings.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C++17
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
